        {
          "id": "G1-RP-001",
          "severity": "blocking",
          "blockingAuthority": "author",
          "title": "Design 缺少必需的 flowkitMutationScope，当前 Proposal 无法形成可执行 Apply mutation authority",
          "problem": "091 Design 只以自然语言列出 expected mutation surface（b1-run-execution-service、publication、resume/adapter modules、resume-context、module-map/evidence 与 tests），但没有当前 production `deriveMutationDeclaration()` 强制读取的 `## flowkitMutationScope` section。当前产品要求 approved Design 恰好包含一个 closed schemaVersion=1 JSON block，并同时定义 apply/revise-apply selectors；没有该 section 时 Apply preparation无法形成 persisted MutationDeclaration。Reviewer在 exact 091 candidate 上直接调用 production `deriveMutationDeclaration(..., 'apply', [091 design ref])`，得到 `MUTATION_DECLARATION_INVALID: Design must contain exactly one flowkitMutationScope section { count: 0 }`。因此 Proposal 当前不是可执行 contract，问题不能留到 Apply 才发现。",
          "contractRef": "Current product mutation-authority contract: src/verification/change-selection/mutation-declaration.ts deriveMutationDeclaration(); AGENTS.md Contract preflight / Apply exact mutation authority；091 Design §6 Expected mutation surface",
          "invariant": "Approved Proposal/Design 必须能够由当前 Flowkit write-side确定性派生 Apply/revise-apply MutationDeclaration；Author不得在 Apply 时临时扩大或猜测 mutation surface。Proposal冻结的 required implementation changes必须全部落入 machine-readable authorized selectors。",
          "requiredOutcome": "Revise Proposal，在 Design 中增加且仅增加一个符合 current closed schema 的 `## flowkitMutationScope` JSON section，冻结 apply 与 revise-apply 的完整 selectors；selectors应覆盖091已冻结的 production/test mutation surface与必要 formal artifacts，但不得借机扩大 G1 scope。随后用 production deriveMutationDeclaration 对 apply/revise-apply 两支实际派生并证明通过，并重新核对 prospective Verification selection 与该 authorized mutation surface闭合。",
          "acceptance": [
            "`design.md` 恰好存在一个 `## flowkitMutationScope` section，JSON满足当前 schemaVersion=1 closed shape，只定义 apply/revise-apply，各自仅含 selectors。",
            "production `deriveMutationDeclaration(repoRoot, 'apply', approvedDesignRef)` PASS，且 `revise-apply` 同样 PASS。",
            "selectors覆盖 G1 已冻结的 replay/path resolver、typed resume projection、single-action adapter、diagnostic consumer、module-map/evidence 与对应 targeted/unit/integration tests；新增文件使用当前 MutationSelector contract允许的精确 path/prefix表达。",
            "selectors不授权 H1 stable Runner、Registry/auto-loop、Delivery Full Test/Finalize/Checkpoint adapter、Actual Architecture、04 Engineering Health或其他未批准范围。",
            "使用冻结 selectors/expected actualChangeSet 重做或核对 production buildVerificationSelection prospective proof，保持 capabilityRelation=matched，并证明新的 G1 integration target有正式 physical resolver closure。"
          ]
        }
      ]
